programs.sol:
"""A token-local spelling detector centered on um, umb and ump.

Bare umb/ump syllable fragments respond most strongly. Whole-word relatives
such as thumb, bump, jump and pump respond less, with weaker inflected forms.
Spaces and capitalization distinguish forms of um. Related fragments and
word families get smaller responses; umatic gets a negative response.
This captures the main lexical family, not its context-sensitive variation
or the component's diffuse responses to unrelated tokens.
"""
READS = ()


def step(carry, prefix, upstream):
    token = prefix.token_strings[-1]
    word = token.strip()
    lower = word.lower()
    spaced = token[:1].isspace()
    value = 0.0

